Use alloc, arena, core, io, and list.
Let p be arena_block(21).
Set p[0] to 1.
Release memory at p.
Let nums be List of whole number.
Push 20 to address of nums.
Let count be count of address of nums.
Say count.
Free list address of nums.
Let used be bytes in use.
If used is not 0.
Stop with error "arena leak".
End the condition.
Give back 0.
